## Parity unit — every region implemented (no scope narrowing)

Data sources (each bound through the page feed → DrivetrainHealthPageData → projection):
  useDrives            → GET /drives            [vehicle_id]          (Operations.Drives.List)
  useDrivetrainHealth  → GET /drivetrain/health [vehicle_id]          (gating read; failure → error state)
  useDrivingStats      → GET /drives/stats      [vehicle_id]          (Operations.Drives.Stats)
  useMotorHistory      → GET /motor             [vehicle_id, limit=200]
  useMotorLatest       → GET /motor/latest      [vehicle_id]

Twelve child regions reproduced (web order), each its own shared feature surface fed from the single
page snapshot (model-driven children take a Model; source-driven children take a page-owned in-memory
ISource that replays the page's snapshot via the child's public mapper/snapshot factory):
   1  HealthOverview          (model)   HealthOverviewModel.Ready(overallHealth, healthScore, motorStatus)
   2  HealthGaugeGrid         (model)   HealthGaugeGridModel.Ready(status, score, motorStatus, 4 sensors, driveStats)
   3  TemperatureGauges       (model)   TemperatureGaugesModel.Ready(4 TemperatureGaugeSensor)
   4  TemperatureMetricCards  (source)  StaticTemperatureMetricCardsSource → TemperatureMetricCardsSnapshot
   5  ThermalLoadPanel        (model)   ThermalLoadPanelModel.Ready(4 ThermalSensorInput, peakKw, avgKw, stats)
   6  LiveMotorStatus         (source)  StaticLiveMotorStatusSource → MotorLiveReading (web {motorLatest && …} gate)
   7  StatorTempChart         (model)   StatorTempChartModel(samples from motorChartData)
   8  TorqueHistoryChart      (source)  StaticTorqueHistoryChartSource → IReadOnlyList<MotorTorqueSample>
   9  TemperatureTrendChart   (model)   TemperatureTrendChartModel(outside-temp points)
  10  PowerOutputChart        (model)   PowerOutputChartModel.Loaded(per-drive peak/regen points)
  11  HealthRecommendations   (source)  StaticHealthRecommendationsSource → DrivetrainHealthSnapshot
  12  DetailCards             (source)  StaticDetailCardsSource → DetailCardsSnapshot

Web memos reproduced verbatim in DrivetrainHealthProjection.Project (SI-canonical, converted only at the
child render boundary): sensors (front/rear @150, inverter @120, battery @60), chartData (today−30d→today
window, ascending, 30-point cap, avg_power_w/1000), peakPower=max, avgPowerMax=mean, minRegenPower=0,
tempTrendData (outsideTemp≠null filter), motorChartData (stator/statorRel/statorRer temps + torque),
HEALTH_SCORE (good 95 / warning 60 / critical 25).

